# Test instruction template (REPO-SPECIFIC — edit then place at .pi/yoowai/instructions/test.md)

Injected into the wai test-analysis prompt for the "test" action only.

## Test-quality checklist

- [ ] Contract tests: request/response shapes and error codes pinned for <FILL ME> (list the endpoints; evidence: the route/controller files).
- [ ] Negative paths: malformed payloads, expired tokens, out-of-range values, provider failures.
- [ ] Lifecycle tests: async/cancellation/disposal paths covered (Flutter widgets/streams: pump, dispose, error states).
- [ ] Coverage of the changed code: at least the branches introduced by this diff are exercised.
- [ ] Tests are deterministic: no wall-clock/flaky dependencies; fixtures isolated.

> Unresolved double-braced keys must be replaced before use — evidence: CI steps or package scripts.

## This repo's test gates (REPLACE)

- [ ] Required command: `{{testCommand}}`.
- [ ] Required fixtures: <FILL ME> (paths; evidence: existing test files/directories, package scripts, or CI configuration).
- [ ] Tests must be added alongside behavior changes (no behavior change without a test).

## Contract precedence

The output contract instructions in the system prompt take precedence over
this checklist. If a rule here conflicts with the requested output format,
follow the contract.
